The program of the shows (names, dates, venues, cards, links) comes from
TheSportsDB (https://www.thesportsdb.com), an open, crowd-sourced sports
database, through its public API (v1). The integration reads it with the free
key of TheSportsDB, or with the premium key of the user, and the widgets show
the source and the time of the last reading. The files under test/fixtures are
reduced copies of answers of this API, kept only to test their reading.

No image of TheSportsDB is part of this repository: the posters of the widget
illustrations are drawn by docs/illustrations/gen.mjs. In Gladys, the posters
of the shows are downloaded from TheSportsDB when a dashboard shows them.

